<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中…</view>

<view wx:if="{{view}}" class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{first}}" class="intro fx-rise">最后一步：到了饭点提醒你拍照，花半分钟设一下。</view>

  <view class="card fx-rise fx-d1">
    <view class="card-title">你的饭点</view>
    <view class="times">
      <view wx:for="{{view.times}}" wx:key="mealType" class="time">
        <view class="time-word">{{item.word}}</view>
        <view class="time-at">{{item.time}}</view>
        <view class="time-window">{{item.window}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted small times-tip">饭点前后 1 小时内拍，都算准时</view>
    <view class="link" bindtap="editTimes">改饭点 ›</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 微信提醒是主力：放在前面。还没开通时一键开通（云函数自己找模板） -->
  <view wx:if="{{!view.wechat}}" class="card fx-rise fx-d2">
    <view class="card-title"><image class="ic" src="/images/icons/chat.svg" mode="aspectFit" />微信提醒</view>
    <view class="text">到了饭点，微信「服务通知」里提醒你拍照，点开就是拍照页。</view>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="setupWechat" disabled="{{working}}">开通微信提醒</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{view.wechat}}" class="card fx-rise fx-d2">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-text">
        <view class="card-title row-title"><image class="ic" src="/images/icons/chat.svg" mode="aspectFit" />微信提醒</view>
        <view class="text">到饭点用微信提醒我</view>
      </view>
      <switch-bar checked="{{view.notify}}" disabled="{{working}}" bindchange="toggleNotify" />
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.notify}}" class="credits">{{view.creditsText}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.whenText}}" class="text when">{{view.whenText}}</view>
    <view class="muted small help">微信规定：每点一次「允许」只能提醒一次。每次拍照打卡会顺手攒一次；第一次弹出来时勾上「总是保持以上选择，不再询问」再点「允许」，以后就不用管了。</view>
    <!-- 排查用的信息平时收起来；提醒服务没在跑才直接写出来 -->
    <block wx:if="{{view.notify}}">
      <view wx:if="{{view.tickBad}}" class="warn">{{view.tickText}}</view>
      <view class="link trouble-link" bindtap="toggleTrouble">{{trouble ? '收起 ‹' : '收不到提醒？ ›'}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{trouble}}" class="trouble">
        <view class="small trouble-line">1. 上面写「次数用完了」的话，下次拍照打卡弹出来时点「允许」。</view>
        <view class="small trouble-line">2. 这顿在饭点之前拍过了，就不会再提醒。</view>
        <view class="small trouble-line">3. 提醒在微信聊天列表的「服务通知」里，不会弹窗。</view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.lastText}}" class="muted small remind-status">上次：{{view.lastText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.tickText && !view.tickBad}}" class="muted small remind-status">{{view.tickText}}</view>
        <button class="btn-plain test-btn" bindtap="testSend" disabled="{{working}}">现在发一条试试</button>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card fx-rise fx-d3">
    <view class="card-title"><image class="ic" src="/images/icons/calendar.svg" mode="aspectFit" />手机闹钟（可选）</view>
    <view class="muted text">在手机日历里加每天重复的闹钟（加一次就行，以后每天自己响），到饭点像闹钟一样响一下；点了进不了小程序。微信规定一次只能加一个，三顿各点一下。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{view.calendarRows}}" wx:key="mealType" class="cal-row">
      <view class="cal-word">{{item.word}} {{item.time}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.added}}" class="done cal-done">已加 ✓</view>
      <button wx:else class="btn-plain cal-btn" data-meal="{{item.mealType}}" bindtap="addCalendar" disabled="{{working}}">{{item.button}}</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.calendarStale}}" class="warn">饭点改过了：手机日历里旧的闹钟要到日历里手动删掉，再点上面「按新饭点加」。</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{first}}">
    <button class="btn-primary btn-big" bindtap="done">设好了，去拍第一顿 ›</button>
    <view class="link link-muted later" bindtap="done">以后再说</view>
  </block>
</view>
